      "name": "Memories and Moments",
      "description": "■ Activates when performing normal attacks while in Making Memories status. Affects self.\n<color=#00AEFF>Effect changes according to the number of attacks. The effect of each phase does not stack. <word_group=10100>Resets</word_group> when Making Memories is removed.\nTwo times: Reloads {description_value_01} round(s).\nFour times: Happy Memories: Number of <word_group=10038>pellets</word_group> ▲ {description_value_02} continuously, stacks up to {description_value_03} time(s).\nSix times: Precious Moments: ATK ▲ {description_value_04}% continuously, stacks up to {description_value_05} time(s).</color>\n■ Activates when using Burst Skill. Affects all shotgun-wielding allies (except self).\n<color=#00AEFF>Attack Damage ▲ {description_value_06}% for {description_value_07} sec.</color>",
