    "cubeNotes": "Arcanalt does not actually need ammo management cubes thanks to both her burst refilling +2 ammo upon use, and after firing 2 shots mid-Burst, she will refill 6 ammo, refilling another 6 for every 6 shots fired during her Burst effect.",
